// Config.xcconfig
// InsightBridge base configuration.
//
// Meta Wearables Device Access Toolkit version decision:
// Findr pinned DAT iOS SDK 0.7.0. This project targets toolkit 1.0,
// pinned in the Xcode project to 1.0.1 or later within 1.x.
// Version 1.0.0 is excluded on purpose: it had a camera frame freeze bug.
//
// Secrets and team settings:
// ClientToken comes from build variables, NEVER hardcoded in source,
// in this file, in Info.plist literals, or in git.
// Set META_CLIENT_TOKEN in a local, uncommitted xcconfig or in the
// Xcode scheme environment for local development, and in CI secrets
// for release builds. Leave it empty in the committed file.
// Dev mode uses MetaAppID 0 in Info.plist, which skips app registration.
// A real MetaAppID and a real ClientToken are only needed for a
// registered, non-dev build.
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM is also left empty in the committed file.
// Set it locally to your Apple Developer team id when signing.

META_CLIENT_TOKEN =
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
SERVER_HOST = 192.168.2.1
